              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE:\nClassify the user request for routing and extract the account PartyNumber.\n\nUSER MESSAGE:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nRUNTIME CONTEXT:\n{{$context.$system.$inputContext}}\n\nTASK:\nReturn valid JSON only with exactly these keys:\n- accountNumber\n- actionName\n\nACTION VALUES:\nUse exactly one of these actionName values:\n- ACCOUNT_NEWS\n- COMPANY_PROFILE\n- OUT_OF_SCOPE\n\nCLASSIFICATION LOGIC:\n1. ACCOUNT_NEWS:\nUse when the user asks for account news, account latest news.\n\n2. COMPANY_PROFILE:\nUse when the user asks for company profile or company profile summary.\n\n3. OUT_OF_SCOPE:\nUse only when the request is not related to generating an account news or company profile. This includes general knowledge, politics, celebrities, entertainment, sports, coding/technical issues, personal advice, or casual conversation.\n\nACCOUNT NUMBER EXTRACTION:\nExtract the PartyNumber/account number from {{$context.$system.$inputContext}} or {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}. Return only the account number value in accountNumber. If not found, return an empty string.\n\nOUTPUT JSON EXAMPLE:\n{\n  \"accountNumber\": \"123456\",\n  \"actionName\": \"ACCOUNT_NEWS\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"accountNumber\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"actionName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
